    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This luxury apartment is part of a multi award winning development that was constructed to a very high standard in 2009. 4 The Waterfront offers 2 double bedrooms/2 Bathrooms and a fantastic spacious living area. \n\nLocated between the sea and Clonakilty town, this bright apartment is situated within easy walking distance of all Clonakilty town amenities. Secured with audio visual, coded access from the street, an elevator brings you up to your door and a patio which is generally shared by one other property.\nWith excellent light afforded from wall to ceiling windows this apartment has a long list of superb features, including car parking, digitally controlled gas heating, mechanical heat recovery ensuring regular air change, broadband, power showers, fitted wardrobes/good storage and back lit wardrobes. \n\nThe Waterfront is a vibrant part of Clonakilty town with Clonakilty Primary Care Centre, pharmacy, Aldi, Lidl, Whales Tail restaurant, Clonakilty Whiskey Distillery and visitor centre all on its doorstep. \nThe apartment comes with car parking for one car and ample parking nearby.\n\nCentrally located in multi-award winning, cosmopolitan and welcoming seaside town of Clonakilty at the heart of West Cork which boast 12 beaches within 12 miles.\n\nAccommodation c. 76 m² / 813 ft²\n\nEntrance Hall 1m x 5.3m\nSpacious, luxurious entrance hall with beautiful finishes including high end tiling, recessed ceiling spotlighting & chrome sockets. Sliding glazed curtain doors to a very useful utility area that includes excellent storage space, shelving units, plumbed for washing machine and dryer.\n\nBathroom 2.9 m x 1.9m plus shower\nFully tiled, power shower enclosure, bath, WC & vanity unit.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room 7.8 m x 4.1 m\nOutstanding room with large, glazed views west and overlooking the plaza below. This room is beautifully finished and has a very spacious feel to it. The kitchen area includes granite work surfaces, fitted kitchen with integrated dishwasher, double oven, hob, extractor, microwave and fridge freezer. \n\nBedroom One 4.3 m x 2.6 m\nSpacious double bedroom, carpeted, fitted wardrobe which is fitted with automatic lighting.\n \nBedroom Two (Master) 4.2 m x 3.2 m\nSpacious double bedroom ensuite, carpeted. The wardrobe is fitted with automatic lighting and there is an ensuite.\n\nEnsuite \nFully tiled, power shower enclosure, WC & vanity unit.\nThis luxury apartment is part of a multi award winning development that was constructed to a very high standard in 2009. 4 The Waterfront offers 2 double bedrooms/2 Bathrooms and a fantastic spacious living space. \n\nServices\nAll mains services are connected to the property and include mains water, drainage. Heating is by means of digitally controlled gas fired central heating with controllable radiator valves. There is a mechanical ventilation system throughout the apartment. The water is pressurized ensuring excellent power showers. \n\nAnnual Management Fee - 3,500 per annum check same \n\nOutside\nExternally the property is beautifully finished with the plaza overlooking street and water. The main entrance door to the spacious lobby has a security coded door. \nThere is a lift up to the apartment and an outside east facing sun terrace that is shared between apt. no. 1 and apartment no. 2, ideal for sitting out."
      },
